continuation_note = "The prior attempt at b4fbe061abfcf0d521f11ce7ffcedbe21d08bc23 executed all three tests: two passed and the switch/send test failed because its exact transfer payload expected lowercase recipient casing. transferTransaction uses ethers.getAddress; the assertion now requires that checksum address for send while retaining the exact supplied address for sendTransaction. No production changes or assertions were removed or weakened."
